to its default. It must send exactly one more GET_AVB_INFO, byte-exact (`KL_srp_domain.sv:157` strobes on revert).\n3. **No change, no notification.** An identical re-declaration, with no DOMAIN_CHANGE strobe, sends nothing (acceptance 2).\n4. **Link edge.** Grade the link-edge leg of the same `ev_avb_i` OR term in the same phase, if the bench can drive it (acceptance 4). If it cannot, say why in the README.\n5. **Mutation.** Each new check needs a planted mutant that turns it red. Removing `srp_evt_domain_change_w` from `ev_avb_i` must turn items 1 and 2 red (acceptance 3). Add the mutants to the suite's mutation table, and show every existing arm still plants.\n6. **Rate limit.** Respect the notification rate limit in `docs/architecture/06_aecp_engine.md`. Wait out its spacing in the bench; never weaken it.\n\n**STOP conditions:**\n- If the RTL fails item 1, 2 or 3, STOP with the red run. Do not fix RTL in this lane.\n- If any record other than the pp_top count changes, STOP.\n\n**Gates:**\n- every processor suite;\n- the pp_top campaign at its counts plus the new checks;\n- `make check`, Yosys and lint;\n- the parent consumer set of 17 at parent dev `28f9666f`, with only the 148 patch (in your output directory).\n\nNo area run: no RTL changes.\n\n**Output:** HANDOFF.md and PR-BODY.md (\"Closes #42\" if every acceptance item is met). Then post REVIEW READY with the head on #42. Do not push.\n\nDo not edit or delete any existing comment.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6008771904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6008782595","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-mila